tch, and it only runs with `-p:SpecificationPath=…`.","ttft_ms":1907,"type":"result","duration_ms":71808,"uuid":"30e774e7-18f4-42dc-b092-cf7e134a451b","ttft_stream_ms":1509,"time_to_request_ms":95,"first_content_frame_ms":1509,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
